# -*- encoding: utf-8 -*-
# Arc: HyralArc | Scene: HyralGoblin2

translate zh strings:

    old "A last high pitched shriek as it spewed out its seed across her cell."
    new "一声尖啸，精液喷溅在她牢房各处。"

    old "A lie to get what he wanted, and now he would leave her here to suffer."
    new "为了得到他想要的而撒的谎，如今却要让她独自在此受苦。"

    old "A cave, Sarah realized, as they neared it."
    new "山洞近在眼前，莎拉意识到这一点。"

    old "A mixture of lust and surprise painted the creature's face."
    new "欲望与惊愕交织，在那怪物的脸上浮现。"

    old "A musky stench that added to her revulsion of him."
    new "一股令人作呕的麝香臭味，更添她对他的厌恶。"

    old "A princess. A sailor. A goblin's wife."
    new "公主。水手。哥布林的女人。"
